## Hints

- E2: linear annualization ×252 ignores compounding and skew — the
  bootstrap on compounded years is the honest version; expect material
  differences (the compounded CI is asymmetric).
- E3: annualize the CI by √252 on the SE, not the endpoints... both
  work if consistent; state what you did.
